26
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:20,591
Kuma ko da yake ba ta dauki
kanta a matsayin mace ba tukunna.

27
00:01:20,592 --> 00:01:22,315
Ta zama tushen
gwagwarmayar duniya

28
00:01:22,316 --> 00:01:24,449
A wajen mata.

29
00:01:25,224 --> 00:01:29,537
Yaƙin duniya na biyu ya yi
tasiri sosai a rayuwar mai tunani.

30
00:01:29,538 --> 00:01:31,684
Beauvoir ta ajiye
matsayinta na rashin siyasa

31
00:01:31,685 --> 00:01:34,017
Kuma ta fara shiga cikin
rigingimun siyasa na lokacin.

32
00:01:34,018 --> 00:01:37,862
Kamar yadda za mu ce a yau.

33
00:01:37,876 --> 00:01:40,342
A cikin shekarun
1970, alal misali.

34
00:01:40,636 --> 00:01:43,415
Ta ƙirƙiri wani motsi na goyon
bayan yanke hukuncin zubar da ciki.

35
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:45,216
Wanda ake kira Choirs.

36
00:01:45,643 --> 00:01:48,576
Mawaƙa na nufin
Zaɓi a cikin Faransanci.

37
00:01:49,117 --> 00:01:52,129
Ta rasu a shekarar 1986;

38
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:53,018
Amma ta tafi

39
00:01:53,019 --> 00:01:56,082
A cikin litattafanta, kasidu
da abubuwan tunawa

40
00:01:56,269 --> 00:01:59,349
Tunani da ke ci gaba da samun
sakamako har zuwa lokacin da ya dace.

41
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,103
Ƙwararriyar, wararru

42
00:02:01,128 --> 00:02:03,725
Tunanin Simone de Beauvoir
shine wanzuwar rayuwa.

43
00:02:05,629 --> 00:02:07,188
Ko kuma a zahiri,

44
00:02:07,189 --> 00:02:09,001
Atheistic wanzuwa,

45
00:02:09,002 --> 00:02:11,002
Wanda ba shi da
tushe na tauhidi.

46
00:02:11,308 --> 00:02:12,641
A bisa wannan tsarin tunani.

47
00:02:12,655 --> 00:02:14,775
Ba a kaddara ba

48
00:02:14,789 --> 00:02:17,789
Ta kowace irin rukunan
falsafa ko ɗabi'a.

49
00:02:18,379 --> 00:02:21,242
Rayuwa ta duniya ba
su da ma'ana ta zahiri.

50
00:02:21,256 --> 00:02:23,761
Amma kowanne
yana iya ba da nasa.

51
00:02:23,762 --> 00:02:26,014
Bugu da ƙari, dole
ne ku ba shi ma'ana.

52
00:02:26,015 --> 00:02:28,281
Idan kana son yin
rayuwa ta gaskiya.

53
00:02:28,793 --> 00:02:31,392
Dan Adam yana da
'yanci, domin haka,

54
00:02:31,393 --> 00:02:33,974
An yanke muku hukuncin
yin zaɓi akai-akai.

55
00:02:33,975 --> 00:02:37,674
Kuma, saboda haka, kai ma ke
da alhakin yanke shawarar kan ku.

56
00:02:37,675 --> 00:02:40,154
Ka yanke shawarar wane
irin mutum kake son zama,
